title: Story1
---
<<set_enabled_in_unity testy false>>
The egg hatches and there it is, your new friend.

Hi! I'm Peeko, your new best friend! You can play with me, talk with me and I'll always be there for you!

Hi, I'm glad to meet you! We are going to have so much fun together!

You're feeling a little excited

Hi Peeko, I'm happy to have you as a friend, but what can I really do with you?

I'll show you around!

<<go_to "Dialogue" "kitchen">>
In the top left corner, you can see how hungry I am. You will have to feed me when I get hungry. Let's try it out!
