title: Story3
---
You are in the play area and you press to play 'Rock Paper Scissors' with Peeko

when Peeko wins, the happiness goes up, when YOU win, Peeko gets mad. Peeko tells you you're cheated.

when it reaches lower than 1 you loose the game and have to start over.

So, you automatically lose.
<<enable_after_dialogue Dialogue>>
